<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Thursday called for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed three percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0900 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 11.73 billion schillings in repos, filling 11 percent of bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
